{"id":"n67747-1-16","stage":5,"title":"여야 · 朝野","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67747-1-16-1","ko":"야당에게는 한마디 상의도 없이 일방적으로 일을 처리해도 됩니까?","zh":"可以不跟在野党商量就单方面处理这件事吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"야당에게는","meaning":"在野党","explanation":"야당：在野党；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"야당","audio":"/audio/0c4b10863db6feeb6b6b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90314","senseId":"1","lemma":"야당","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"야당에게는","audio":"/audio/cdc771d7dbe684a8aed5.mp3"}},{"text":"한마디","meaning":"一句话","explanation":"한마디：一句话。","readings":[{"term":"한마디","audio":"/audio/edfef6246c15728649d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84885","senseId":"1","lemma":"한마디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한마디","audio":"/audio/edfef6246c15728649d2.mp3"}},{"text":"상의도","meaning":"商量，商议，讨论","explanation":"상의：商量，商议，讨论；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"상의","audio":"/audio/1c544f65165f775139d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62793","senseId":"1","lemma":"상의","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상의도","audio":"/audio/f1fa203ec8d82a58f9ed.mp3"}},{"text":"없이","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없이：没有。","readings":[{"term":"없이","audio":"/audio/c4b723256abd5d51c1f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89918","senseId":"9","lemma":"없이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없이","audio":"/audio/c4b723256abd5d51c1f1.mp3"}},{"text":"일방적으로","meaning":"单方面，单边","explanation":"일방적：单方面，单边；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"일방적","audio":"/audio/95b9efa14c885d1e3391.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72727","senseId":"1","lemma":"일방적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일방적으로","audio":"/audio/ef1e93151c619fc1af34.mp3"}},{"text":"일을","meaning":"事，工作","explanation":"일：事，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"5","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일을","audio":"/audio/9a5fd6c2b18669a93295.mp3"}},{"text":"처리해도","meaning":"处理，办理，受理","explanation":"처리하다：处理，办理，受理；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"처리하다","audio":"/audio/e9cb6f08d29afdcfefb2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78720","senseId":"1","lemma":"처리하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"처리해도","audio":"/audio/4d644eeb5ea8208e21fc.mp3"}},{"text":"됩니까?","meaning":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","explanation":"되다：可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"됩니까","audio":"/audio/571187496de842dc35bb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"0c4b10863db6feeb","term":"야당","zh":"在野党","audio":"/audio/0c4b10863db6feeb6b6b.mp3","entryId":"90314","definition":"没有执掌现政权的政党。","pronunciation":["야ː당"]},{"id":"edfef6246c157286","term":"한마디","zh":"一句话","audio":"/audio/edfef6246c15728649d2.mp3","entryId":"84885","definition":"短而简单的话。","pronunciation":["한마디"]},{"id":"1c544f65165f7751","term":"상의","zh":"商量，商议，讨论","audio":"/audio/1c544f65165f775139d6.mp3","entryId":"62793","definition":"相互交换意见。","pronunciation":["상의","상이"]},{"id":"c4b723256abd5d51","term":"없이","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/c4b723256abd5d51c1f1.mp3","entryId":"89918","definition":"理由或可能性等不成立地。","pronunciation":["업ː씨"]},{"id":"95b9efa14c885d1e","term":"일방적","zh":"单方面，单边","audio":"/audio/95b9efa14c885d1e3391.mp3","entryId":"72727","definition":"偏向某一边或某方的。","pronunciation":["일방적"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"需要解决或处理的问题或事项。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"e9cb6f08d29afdcf","term":"처리하다","zh":"处理，办理，受理","audio":"/audio/e9cb6f08d29afdcfefb2.mp3","entryId":"78720","definition":"按步骤整理并完成工作、业务或案件等。","pronunciation":["처ː리하다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c5aa1c1da4ba153b8137.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67747-1-16-2","ko":"이전에 여야 지도자 회담을 통해서 다 결정된 문제 아니었습니까.","zh":"之前不是已经通过朝野领袖会谈把所有问题都决定好了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이전에","meaning":"以前，之前","explanation":"이전：以前，之前；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이전","audio":"/audio/da7e61c67cc5a90f0630.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70752","senseId":"1","lemma":"이전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이전에","audio":"/audio/4f422eb4e4b9519f0146.mp3"}},{"text":"여야","meaning":"朝野","explanation":"여야：朝野。","readings":[{"term":"여야","audio":"/audio/287155ed9caff7ea1809.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67747","senseId":"1","lemma":"여야","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여야","audio":"/audio/287155ed9caff7ea1809.mp3"}},{"text":"지도자","meaning":"领导者，领导人","explanation":"지도자：领导者，领导人。","readings":[{"term":"지도자","audio":"/audio/0e9bd3b3e0ff60307cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27791","senseId":"1","lemma":"지도자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지도자","audio":"/audio/0e9bd3b3e0ff60307cd1.mp3"}},{"text":"회담을","meaning":"会谈，会晤，谈判","explanation":"회담：会谈，会晤，谈判；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"회담","audio":"/audio/fa911e269983df1cbd72.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88122","senseId":"1","lemma":"회담","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회담을","audio":"/audio/58f94f7cb53a682b9ea4.mp3"}},{"text":"통해서","meaning":"通过，利用，使用","explanation":"통하다：通过，利用，使用；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"통하다","audio":"/audio/feb666c5640cabcc5d63.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58169","senseId":"10","lemma":"통하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"통해서","audio":"/audio/b3c36bfc724ac74bc981.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"결정된","meaning":"被确定，已决定","explanation":"결정되다：被确定，已决定；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"결정되다","audio":"/audio/5c9d8e9c7f736f0ed297.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61093","senseId":"1","lemma":"결정되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"결정된","audio":"/audio/bf2fbcc009d32e00ed81.mp3"}},{"text":"문제","meaning":"问题","explanation":"문제：问题。","readings":[{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66246","senseId":"2","lemma":"문제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}},{"text":"아니었습니까.","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；습니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；습니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"아니었습니까","audio":"/audio/5257bf3841daad77ff64.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니었습니까","audio":"/audio/5257bf3841daad77ff64.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da7e61c67cc5a90f","term":"이전","zh":"以前，之前","audio":"/audio/da7e61c67cc5a90f0630.mp3","entryId":"70752","definition":"比现在往前。","pronunciation":["이ː전"]},{"id":"287155ed9caff7ea","term":"여야","zh":"朝野","audio":"/audio/287155ed9caff7ea1809.mp3","entryId":"67747","definition":"执政党与在野党。","pronunciation":["여ː야"]},{"id":"0e9bd3b3e0ff6030","term":"지도자","zh":"领导者，领导人","audio":"/audio/0e9bd3b3e0ff60307cd1.mp3","entryId":"27791","definition":"教导别人而引领的人。","pronunciation":["지도자"]},{"id":"fa911e269983df1c","term":"회담","zh":"会谈，会晤，谈判","audio":"/audio/fa911e269983df1cbd72.mp3","entryId":"88122","definition":"与某问题相关的人们聚到一起商讨；或者这种商讨。","pronunciation":["회ː담","훼ː담"]},{"id":"feb666c5640cabcc","term":"통하다","zh":"通过，利用，使用","audio":"/audio/feb666c5640cabcc5d63.mp3","entryId":"58169","definition":"在做某事时，以人或物体为媒介。","pronunciation":["통하다"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"5c9d8e9c7f736f0e","term":"결정되다","zh":"被确定，已决定","audio":"/audio/5c9d8e9c7f736f0ed297.mp3","entryId":"61093","definition":"被明确地确定怎么做某事。","pronunciation":["결쩡되다","결쩡뒈다"]},{"id":"bc0fca46ae9a4879","term":"문제","zh":"问题","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3","entryId":"66246","definition":"成为争论、讨论或研究等对象的事宜。","pronunciation":["문ː제"]}],"audio":"/audio/cd1b6b9c3ee8a9a45016.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":6.045,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67747","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":179,"sequenceScore":6.5217,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["可以不跟在野党商量就单方面处理这件事吗？","之前不是已经通过朝野领袖会谈把所有问题都决定好了吗？","这些士兵的纪律真严明啊。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["可以不跟在野党商量就单方面处理这件事吗？","之前不是已经通过朝野领袖会谈把所有问题都决定好了吗？","这些士兵的纪律真严明啊。"],"answer":1}]}
